# AnchorSafe Design System

## Project Design Overview

**AnchorSafe** follows a modern marine-tech design language inspired by clean navigation systems and real-world marine applications. The interface is designed to feel professional, calm, responsive, and easy to use while keeping navigation safety and environmental awareness as the main focus.

The design system prioritizes:
- Clear navigation
- Fast interaction
- Real-time visibility
- Accessibility
- Minimal and modern UI
- Mobile-first experience

---

# Design Language

## Visual Style
- Modern marine-tech interface
- Minimal and clean design
- Ocean-inspired color palette
- Professional navigation app aesthetic
- Smooth and responsive interactions

## Design Principles
- Clarity over complexity
- Safety-first user experience
- One primary action per screen
- Accessible and readable UI
- Fast and predictable interactions

