---

## Center Section
### Interactive Marine Map

The map is the main feature of the application and displays:
- User location
- Safe anchoring zones
- Dangerous zones
- Protected marine areas
- Ports and marinas

---

## Floating Action Button

### Emergency SOS Button
Located at the bottom-right corner for quick emergency access.

---

## Bottom Information Card

A draggable information card displaying:
