# MVP Design Goal

The first working version of the application should include:
- Full-screen marine map
- Bottom navigation
- Floating search bar
- Zone polygons
- Warning popups
- Bottom information card

The MVP should prioritize usability, navigation clarity, and real-time interaction over unnecessary visual complexity.
